# Brief cache and downloaded datasets (services/api). Keyed by address hash; never commit it.
# The hand-curated tariff table and the step-4 indexes (what SAM 3.1 measured per area, what
# Voice Transcribe heard per meeting) are source, not cache. Imagery tiles and recordings are not.
data/*
!data/tariffs.json
!data/facilities.json
!data/perception/
data/perception/*
!data/perception/*.json
!data/hearings/
